<title>USA: Gresham-Barlow, Ore., school bonds won by Merrill.</title>
<headline>Gresham-Barlow, Ore., school bonds won by Merrill.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said Thursday it won $32.1 million Gresham-Barlow School District No 10JT, Ore., bonds at a true interest cost of 5.408 percent.</p>
</text>
